  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Rail Interdiction Training II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To share CBP inspection techniques and methodologies with foreign counterpart agencies within the host nations rail port of entry environment. To provide the skills and knowledge necessary to carry out effective inspection, detection, cargo and passenger processing as well as the investigation/prosecution of contraband traffickers. Specific emphasis is placed on weapons of mass destruction (WMD), their components and delivery systems</narrative>
  </description>
